00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:57.080
French person.

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.960
Which

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.720
is probably why most Americans, after

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:03.760
going through Spanish for like a decade,

